{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2021-11-08 16:16:00', 'title': 'AIG TO REDEEM 5.60% DEBENTURES DUE JULY 31, 2097', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. (NYSE: AIG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL REDEEM ALL OF ITS OUTSTANDING 5.60% DEBENTURES DUE JULY 31, 2097, ORIGINALLY ISSUED BY SUNAMERICA, INC. (CUSIP: 866930AG5) (THE “DEBENTURES”) ON DECEMBER 8, 2021 (THE “REDEMPTION DATE”). ON THE REDEMPTION DATE, AIG WILL PAY TO THE REGISTERED HOLDERS OF THE DEBENTURES A REDEMPTION PRICE PER $1,000 PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF DEBENTURES AS DETERMINED IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE INDENTURE GOVERNING THE DEBENT'}